    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "同　金　四十三兩壹分三朱永五十三文壹分八厘"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "同（雑税）　金　四十三両一分三朱　永五十三文一分八厘"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Miscellaneous tax (同 = ditto, continuing the 雜税米 line that ends the facing earlier leaf, upper_p040_left), paid in gold: 43 ryō 1 bu 3 shu, together with 53.18 mon in ei-denominated cash. At 4 bu to the ryō and 4 shu to the bu the gold alone is 43.4375 ryō; adding the ei-cash gives 43.49068 ryō, which is exactly what the 此米 conversion in the next column uses."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "伯太雜税金"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/upper_p041_right.jpg",
