        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "（合現石　六千七十三石二斗九升一合七勺）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Combined current rice: 6,073.2917 koku — the domain's tax receipts in rice and rice-equivalents added together. It closes exactly against the two tax lines on the facing earlier leaf (upper_p040_left): regular tax rice 5,995.3023 koku plus miscellaneous tax rice 72.5531 koku plus the 5.4363 koku rice equivalent of the gold in the two columns to the right = 6,073.2917. Sub-units run strictly descending: 二斗 (0.2), 九升 (0.09), 一合 (0.001), 七勺 (0.0007)."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "伯太合現石"
